3386 0 obj
  << /ActualText (PlayBud\054 is designed to connect players and enhance their game experience using AI and smartwatches\056 \n\nThe idea is to create a platform where users can find and join matches\054 track their performance\054 and improve their skills\056 The smartwatches provided at the playing ground collect real\055time data like speed\054 stamina\054 accuracy\054 and other metrics during the match\056\n\nAfter the game\054 the AI processes this data and provides users with a detailed performance summary\056 It includes key stats\054 highlights of their best moments\054 and personalized feedback on areas to improve\056 Think of it as a personalized \047Spotify Wrapped\047 for sports matches\054 helping users understand their strengths and track their growth over time\056\n\nBy focusing on a data\055driven approach without needing expensive setups like cameras\054 we\220re making performance tracking affordable\054 accessible\054 and engaging for all players\056 \n\nIt\220s not just about playing\204it\220s about growing and competing smarter\056\042)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 3387 0 R
     /Pg 2840 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
